{"id":"espaiat-margin-i-padding","title":"Espaiat - margin i padding","topic":"css","topicLabel":"CSS","tags":["aprendizaje","css"],"course":null,"headings":[{"depth":2,"text":"¿Qué es?","id":"que-es"},{"depth":2,"text":"¿Cómo se escribe? (Sintaxis)","id":"como-se-escribe-sintaxis"}],"readingMins":1,"codeBlocks":0.5,"words":28,"backlinks":[{"id":"sesion-07-18-05-26","title":"Sesion_07_18.05.26","topicLabel":"HTML","session":7}],"html":"<h2 id=\"que-es\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">¿Qué es?</h2><p>Són claus per &quot;donar aire&quot; al disseny:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Padding</strong>: És l&#39;espai interior, entre el contingut i la vora del quadre. Empeny el contingut cap a dins.</li>\n<li><strong>Margin</strong>: És l&#39;espai exterior, la distància que separa el quadre dels altres elements del voltant .</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"como-se-escribe-sintaxis\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">¿Cómo se escribe? (Sintaxis)</h2><div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">css</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.tarjeta</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">padding</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">25px</span>; <span class=\"hljs-comment\">/* Espai interior */</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">margin</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">20px</span>;  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">/* Espai exterior */</span>\n}</code></pre></div>"}